# Squimbo — copywriting

Skill: [friends-copywriting](../skills/friends-copywriting/SKILL.md). Locale: [friends-i18n.mdc](./friends-i18n.mdc).

Voice: **party host**, short, concrete. Not a growth landing page.

GitHub / `docs/` prose is a different job: [friends-docs](../skills/friends-docs/SKILL.md).

## MUST

- Sentence 1 answers. CTAs are verb + object (`Start the round`, `Vote`).
- Facts from [docs/product.md](../../docs/product.md) — do not invent packs or monetization.
- Ship en + pl together.

## MUST NOT

- “Unlock your journey”, “seamless experience”, competitor brand claims.
- Copy third-party proprietary prompt wording.
